  "details": "When taking screenshots with F12, the picture will be flipped depending on whether your camera is flipped. This happens regardless of whether it's open or not.\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Take a screenshot with F12 and observe it (text works great for this)\n\n2. Open the camera and press the \"Flip Camera\" button so that it looks at you (this works in flying mode regardless)\n\n3. Close the camera\n\n4. Press F12 again and observe the new screenshot",
